    "updated_basis": "pdf-last-modified"
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-11-03",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "You can edit or delete a landmine policy that you configured in the Zscaler Deception Admin Portal."
    },
    {
      "text": "Any changes made to a landmine policy can take a few hours to reflect on the endpoints."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Editing a Landmine Policy",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To edit a landmine policy:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Log in to the Deception Admin Portal.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, go to Deceive > Landmine > Policies.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          35,
          42
        ],
        [
          45,
          53
        ],
        [
          56,
          64
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Locate the policy that you want to edit, and click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          55,
          59
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the policy window, modify the policy configuration per your requirements. You can modify:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Password Settings",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Defense Evasion",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Privilege Escalation",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Cloud Lures",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Browser Lures",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Session Lures",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "File Decoys",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Lure Settings",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Advanced Deception Capabilities",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Deleting Landmine Policies",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To delete one or more landmine policies:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Log in to the Deception Admin Portal.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, go to Deceive > Landmine > Policies.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          35,
          42
        ],
        [
          45,
          53
        ],
        [
          56,
          64
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Policies page, do one of the following:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "To delete a single policy, locate the policy that you want to delete, and click the Delete icon.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          84,
          90
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "To delete multiple policies, select the policies that you want to delete, and click Delete Selected.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          84,
          99
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the confirmation window, click OK.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          34,
          36
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
}
